{"overview":"مهاجر مکزیکی و مادر تنها، فلور مورنو، کار خانه‌داری را برای دِبورا و جان کلاسکی، زوجی مرفه با دو فرزند، پیدا می‌کند؛ وقتی فلور اعتراف می‌کند که به‌دلیل دخترش، کریستینا، نمی‌تواند برنامه را تحمل کند، دِبورا تصمیم می‌گیرد که آن‌ها به خانه کلاسکی نقل مکان کنند؛ فرهنگ‌ها در تضادند و تنش‌ها بالا می‌رود در حالی که فلور و کلاسکی‌ها برای به‌اشتراک‌گذاری فضا و پرورش فرزندان خود به‌صورت کاملاً متفاوت، می‌جنگند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Mexican immigrant and single mother Flor Moreno finds housekeeping work with Deborah and John Clasky, a well-off couple with two children of their own. When Flor admits she can't handle the schedule because of her daughter, Cristina, Deborah decides they should move into the Clasky home. Cultures clash and tensions run high as Flor and the Claskys struggle to share space while raising their children on their own, and very different, terms.","tagline_en":"Every family has a hero.","runtime":130,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["جیمز ال. بروکز"],"crew_en":["James L. Brooks"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"آدام سندلر","role":"John Clasky","photo":"/iTMnXrPfC1rmom6a9q4hy6YSJWG.jpg","en":"Adam Sandler"},{"name":"تیا لئونی","role":"Deborah Clasky","photo":"/vWijsKTlNs9bgKdUVgsr2w4msGo.jpg","en":"Téa Leoni"},{"name":"Paz Vega","role":"Flor Moreno","photo":"/fNLlJysFd5f0Q8Lj20EZpU8BiRN.jpg"},{"name":"کلوریس لیچمن","role":"Evelyn Wright","photo":"/o8pnV9urjuHZDAR2u4UjPy2CR1u.jpg","en":"Cloris Leachman"},{"name":"Shelbie Bruce","role":"Christina","photo":"/3WIFI11RQp1r4HlCXyHL6jObDrw.jpg"},{"name":"Sarah Steele","role":"Bernice","photo":"/ytxx4G6gILYIJmBV7rdUiOm4hZF.jpg"},{"name":"Ian Hyland","role":"Georgie","photo":"/v1CISuebV0M9VVFG1fkmNWpLhbC.jpg"},{"name":"Victoria Luna","role":"Cristina (6 Years Old)","photo":"/jhqpHsiXmUnvUdZk4rv54u2ki0J.jpg"},{"name":"Cecilia Suárez","role":"Monica","photo":"/m2lUTpivduEiRwyPIrdg8hcI8zq.jpg"},{"name":"Ricardo Molina","role":"Flor's Husband","photo":"/ubtiODxiE8Ne0axLW